{"id":"10-d7d9f1e3ce","name":"鍛冶谷戸","reading":"カジガイト","reading_estimated":false,"variants":[],"status":"historical","renamed_to":null,"admin":{"pref_code":"10","pref":"群馬県","municipality_code":null,"municipality":"桐生市","oaza":"広沢町四丁目","koaza":"鍛冶谷戸","historical_village":"中広沢村"},"location":{"lat":36.378734,"lon":139.333426,"precision":"oaza","geocode_source":"geolonia"},"area_key":"10203034004","hazard_types":["slope_failure"],"elements":[{"element_id":"kaji_kamu","surface":"鍛冶","reading":"カジ","meaning":"「鍛冶」「かち」はカジ（噛）るの語幹で崩壊地名。斜面が噛み取られたように崩れた地形。"},{"element_id":"yato","surface":"谷戸","reading":"ヤト","meaning":"谷口・低湿地。桐生市域では谷口の地名が集落名に転じた例が多い。豊川市の貝津（カイツ）は垣内由来とされるが小河川沿いに分布する傾向がある。"}],"etymology_summary":"２２１１～２２８０番地。慶長３年（１５９８）上下広沢村の間に中広沢村を分村した時、上広沢村鍛冶屋谷戸を二つに分割した区域で、同名では都合が悪いので鍛冶谷戸にした区域。鍛冶はカジ（噛）るの語幹で崩壊地名。谷戸は谷口をいう地名であったが、地形上人が住み良い所なので、最初に集落が出来た","evidence":[{"kind":"local_history","stance":"supports","source_id":"kiryu_timeikou_2000","locator":null,"quote":"鍛冶はカジ（噛）るの語幹で崩壊地名。","claim":"『桐生市地名考』が鍛冶谷戸を災害由来の地名と明記する（崩壊地名・崩壊）","level":2,"extracted_by":"human","quote_verified":true}],"evidence_level":2,"disputed":false,"dispute_note":null,"hazard_corroboration":{"debris_flow_zone":false,"steep_slope_zone":false,"landslide_zone":false,"flood_zone":false,"tsunami_zone":false,"storm_surge_zone":false,"avalanche_risk":false,"nearest_monument_ids":["10203-001","10203-002"],"related_disasters":[],"sampled_at":"2026-09-11T01:46:59+00:00"},"review":{"status":"auto","reviewer":null,"note":null},"dataset":"kiryu_timeikou","evidenceLevelLabel":"災害由来・替字の明記","hazardLabels":["崖崩れ・斜面崩壊"]}
